% expect-output: 20.0
% expect-output: 0.0
% expect-output: 50.0
% expect-output: 10.0
% expect-output: 98
% Scenario: Type 3 glyph widths. stringwidth runs BuildGlyph and reads
% the width setcachedevice declares; show advances by it; a BuildChar
% font receives the code instead of the name.
% Expect: 20.0 0.0, 50.0 10.0, then 98.
/r { 1000 mul round 1000 div } def
/Sq 7 dict dup begin
  /FontType 3 def
  /FontMatrix [0.001 0 0 0.001 0 0] def
  /Encoding StandardEncoding def
  /FontBBox [0 0 1000 1000] def
  /BuildGlyph { pop pop 1000 0 0 0 1000 1000 setcachedevice 0 0 1000 1000 rectfill } def
end definefont pop
/Sq findfont 20 scalefont setfont
(a) stringwidth r exch r = =
10 10 moveto (aa) show currentpoint r exch r = =
/Codes << /FontType 3 /FontMatrix [0.001 0 0 0.001 0 0] /Encoding StandardEncoding
  /BuildChar { exch pop /seen exch def 600 0 setcharwidth } >> definefont
10 scalefont setfont
(b) stringwidth pop pop seen =
showpage
